# n-dx — runtime artifacts and ephemeral state
#
# Drop this block into your project's .gitignore after running `ndx init`.
#
# What to KEEP in git:
#   .rex/prd_tree/          ← PRD storage (always commit)
#   .rex/config.json        ← rex project config
#   .hench/config.json      ← agent config (model, max turns)
#   CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md   ← assistant instruction files
#
# Optional commits (see docs/guide/gitignore.md for the tradeoffs):
#   .sourcevision/          ← commit to share analysis baseline with teammates
#   .n-dx.json              ← safe to commit: `ndx config` never writes API keys here
#   .codex/config.toml      ← commit if your team uses Codex

# Analysis output (regenerated by `ndx analyze`)
.sourcevision/

# Agent runs, locks, and session state
.hench/runs/
.hench/locks/
# Adversarial-review reports, one JSON per run (`ndx work --review`)
.hench/reviews/
# Per-session token-usage watermarks written by `hench record`
.hench/usage-cursors/
# Warm-parent session cache, rewritten on every orientation. Machine-local.
.hench/session-cache.json
.hench-commit-msg.txt

# Rex ephemeral state
.rex/.backups/
.rex/.cache/
.rex/*.lock
.rex/pending-proposals.json
.rex/acknowledged-findings.json
.rex/execution-log*.jsonl
.rex/adapters.json
.rex/n-dx_workflow.md

# Server runtime
.n-dx-web.pid
.n-dx-web.port
# Dashboard LLM spend ledger, one line per Ask call (`ndx start`)
.n-dx-web-usage.jsonl

# Run logs
.run-logs/

# Local config overrides — machine paths (*.cli_path) and API keys (*.api_key)
# are written here by `ndx config`, never to the shared .n-dx.json.
.n-dx.local.json
*.local.json

# Assistant local settings (personal, not shared)
.claude/settings.local.json
